<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat June subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to June totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    773,302  (601,049)  3,439,050  (2,879,859)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    158,163  (195,269)  1,091,634  (1,126,776)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	21,479   (36,372)     86,828    (103,021)</p>
<p> Linseed expls    12,978    (4,933)     77,094     (61,410)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    3,505	(nil)     19,194     (15,156)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   10,423   (26,621)     88,800    (119,909)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     132,972  (132,812)    642,371     (575,645</p>
<p>    Sunoil     116,294    (136,624)   688,8161    (756,032)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in June were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: China 110,001; Iran 96,633; Romania 67,703; Holland 60,580; Italy 76,177</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 78,975; Thailand 22,100; United Kingdom 16,209</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
